  "_tables": "yacc tables (writable .data) rewritten so state 0 shifts token R (= a P05 rule number) into reduce state R+0x277 (0x11 -> state 1, 0x22 -> state 2, default rules 0x11/0x22); every P05 rule has length 2 and goes back to state 0, so a run reduces one rule per lexer token. Values: top[0] = parser+0xc, top[-1] = previous rule value, top[-n] (n>=2) = valueStack object +0x420-0x10*n.",
